{"meta":{"id":"tt0120815","type":"movie","name":"Rescatando al soldado Ryan","imdb_id":"tt0120815","description":"Segunda Guerra Mundial, 1944. Tras el desembarco de los Aliados en Normandía, a un grupo de soldados americanos se le encomienda una peligrosa misión: poner a salvo al soldado James Ryan. Los hombres de la patrulla del capitán John Miller deben arriesgar sus vidas para encontrar a este soldado, cuyos tres hermanos han muerto en la guerra. Lo único que se sabe del soldado Ryan es que se lanzó con su escuadrón de paracaidistas detrás de las líneas enemigas.","poster":"https://btttr.cc/poster-q/imdb/poster-default/tt0120815.jpg?tag=none&lang=es-MX&rs=IM","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/bdD39MpSVhKjxarTxLSfX6baoMP.jpg","logo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/mysYaiSqjxyt1eUmC6CfVeBqAyx.png","genres":["Bélica","Drama","Historia"],"releaseInfo":"1998","released":"1998-07-24T12:00:00.000Z","status":"Released","runtime":"169 min","imdbRating":"8.6","country":"United States of America","cast":["Tom Hanks","Tom Sizemore","Edward Burns","Barry Pepper","Adam Goldberg","Vin Diesel","Giovanni Ribisi","Jeremy Davies","Matt Damon","Ted Danson","Paul Giamatti","Dennis Farina","Joerg Stadler","Max Martini","Dylan Bruno","Daniel Cerqueira","Demetri Goritsas","Ian Porter","Gary Sefton","Julian Spencer","Steve Griffin","William Marsh","Marc Cass","Markus Napier","Neil Finnighan","Peter Miles","Paul Garcia","Seamus McQuade","Ronald Longridge","Adam Shaw"],"director":["Steven Spielberg"],"writer":["Robert Rodat"],"trailers":[{"source":"RYExstiQlLc","type":"Trailer","name":"Saving Private Ryan - Trailer","ytId":"RYExstiQlLc","lang":"en"},{"source":"y4SA9yUDgW8","type":"Trailer","name":"Saving Private Ryan (1998) Theatrical Trailer [5.1] [4K] [FTD-1282]","ytId":"y4SA9yUDgW8","lang":"en"},{"source":"PrthROm6ocY","type":"Trailer","name":"Saving Private Ryan (1998) - Official Re-Release Trailer | 4K","ytId":"PrthROm6ocY","lang":"en"}],"trailerStreams":[{"ytId"